invariant: INV-14
file: rec.c
catches: webpki_resume_record
reason: ch_record_init never writes ch_tls.ticket_config_hash in a webpki
  build, so the tickets a record-mode session receives are bound to an
  all-zero hash and none resumes the configuration that received it.
  The received-ticket rows object.

--- old
    webpki_ticket_config_hash(cfg, r->t.ticket_config_hash);
--- new
    (void)cfg;
